@Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress = http://localhost:51001

### Startup probe
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/health/startup
Accept: application/json

### Readiness probe
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/health/readiness
Accept: application/json

### Liveness probe
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/health/liveness
Accept: application/json

### Search users (SearchUser)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users?text=e2e&sortBy=userName&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a user (CreateUser, critical: sign in with TOTP or step up first)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "officer.one", "displayName": "Officer One", "roles": ["BorderShiftSupervisor"] }

### Grant a role (EditUser, critical)
PUT {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/roles/TerminalDutyManager
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Audit trail for one user (SearchAuditEntry)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/audit-entries?targetId={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create an airport (CreateAirport, all-sites administrators)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/airports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "iataCode": "DMO", "icaoCode": "ODMO", "name": "Demo International", "timeZoneId": "Asia/Amman" }

### Create a terminal in a site (CreateTerminal)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/terminals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "airportId": "{{airportId}}", "code": "T1", "name": "Terminal 1", "siteCode": "AMM" }

### Create a level (CreateLevel)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/levels
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "terminalId": "{{terminalId}}", "code": "L0", "name": "Arrivals", "floorNumber": 0, "widthMetres": 300, "depthMetres": 120 }

### Create a checkpoint (CreateCheckpoint)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/checkpoints
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "levelId": "{{levelId}}", "code": "IMM", "name": "Immigration", "kind": "Immigration" }

### Create a desk (CreateDesk)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/desks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "checkpointId": "{{checkpointId}}", "code": "D01", "kind": "Desk", "laneCategories": ["CIT", "RES"] }

### Search desks of a checkpoint (SearchDesk)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/desks?parentId={{checkpointId}}&sortBy=code
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a desk range D01 to D22 (CreateDesk)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/desks/range
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "checkpointId": "{{checkpointId}}", "prefix": "D", "from": 1, "to": 22, "width": 2, "kind": "Desk", "laneCategories": ["CIT"] }

### Map an AMAN desk code (CreateDeskCodeMapping)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/desk-code-mappings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "system": "Aman", "externalCode": "A-07", "deskId": "{{deskId}}" }

### Upload a floor plan, replacing any previous one (CreateFloorPlan; PNG, JPEG or SVG, at most 20 MB)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/levels/{{levelId}}/floor-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=plan

--plan
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="arrivals.svg"
Content-Type: image/svg+xml

<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="3000" height="1200"><rect width="3000" height="1200" fill="#eef"/></svg>
--plan
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metresPerPixel"

0.1
--plan
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="originX"

0
--plan
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="originY"

0
--plan--

### Floor plan metadata and image (ViewFloorPlan)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/levels/{{levelId}}/floor-plan/content
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Calibrate: scale and origin (EditFloorPlan)
PUT {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/levels/{{levelId}}/floor-plan/calibration
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "metresPerPixel": 0.1, "originX": 0, "originY": 0 }

### Zone profile history of a site (SearchZoneProfile)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/zone-profiles?siteCode=AMM
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### New draft, copied from the published version (CreateZoneProfile)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/zone-profiles/drafts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "siteCode": "AMM", "name": "Arrivals immigration" }

### Add a queue zone to the draft (EditZoneProfile)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/zone-profiles/{{profileId}}/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Snake A", "kind": "Queue", "levelId": "{{levelId}}", "polygon": "10 10,34 10,34 22,10 22" }

### Add its entry line (EditZoneProfile)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/zone-profiles/{{profileId}}/lines
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Entry A", "role": "Entry", "levelId": "{{levelId}}", "startX": 10, "startY": 12, "endX": 10, "endY": 16, "zoneId": "{{zoneId}}" }

### What stops the draft from being published (ViewZoneProfile)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/zone-profiles/{{profileId}}/validation
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Publish the geometry you validated (PublishZoneProfile; geometryHash from the validation; needs a token from a sign-in or step-up with a code in the last 15 minutes)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/zone-profiles/{{profileId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "geometryHash": "{{geometryHash}}" }

### Devices of a site (SearchDevice; ARV-021)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/devices?siteCode=DMO&state=Commissioning
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### The BOQ's assumed footprint for the form (SearchDevice)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/devices/assumed-footprint?family=StereoVision&mountingHeightMetres=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Register a sensor over a queue zone (CreateDevice; critical: a code in the last 15 minutes). The answer carries the credential once.
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "S-17", "family": "StereoVision", "model": "PC2SE", "transport": "HttpsPush", "dialect": "Xovis", "clockSource": "Ntp",
  "placement": { "levelId": "{{levelId}}", "x": 30, "y": 25, "mountingHeightMetres": 5, "orientationDegrees": 0, "queueZoneName": "A-VIS" } }

### Record a calibration; at or above 95 percent the device goes Online (EditDevice)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/devices/{{deviceId}}/calibrations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "ManualCountTally", "sampleSize": 200, "countingAccuracyPercent": 96.5, "waitTimeErrorMinutes": 0.4, "notes": "Morning peak, two hours" }

### Rotate the credential (CreateDevice; critical); the old one stops working at once
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/devices/{{deviceId}}/credential
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Retire (DeleteDevice)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/devices/{{deviceId}}/retire
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ARV-118: the site operating calendar (ViewSite to read; EditSite to change; entries are recorded before they take effect)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/sites/DMO/calendar
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Weekly hours in the site's local time from a future local day (replaces a version of the same day)
PUT {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/sites/DMO/calendar/weeks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "effectiveFrom": "2026-10-12", "hours": [ { "day": "Monday", "opens": "06:00", "closes": "22:00" }, { "day": "Friday", "opens": "18:00", "closes": "02:00" } ] }

### A dated exception (closed all day, or other hours)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/sites/DMO/calendar/exceptions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-12-02", "closed": true, "hours": [], "reason": "National Day" }

### An announced maintenance window (UTC, whole minutes, starting after now)
POST {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/sites/DMO/calendar/maintenance-windows
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startsUtc": "2026-10-13T01:00:00Z", "endsUtc": "2026-10-13T02:00:00Z", "reason": "Database upgrade" }

### Availability per local day, week and range (DataQuality.View; at most 92 days)
GET {{Ariva.Api.Main_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sites/DMO/availability?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
